- Publish round mailbox notifications after database commit
  Subscribers wake only for stored participations, and a conflicting owner
  binding fails the round without stopping the coordinator.
  [#8](https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/scuttle/pull/8)
- Broadcast decided expiry payouts during long decision passes
  After a new block, the watchman sends pending payouts between tree decisions.
  [#11](https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/scuttle/pull/11)
- Limit payout status lookups to the relevant expiry payouts
  Receipt and decision queries avoid a full scan of payout history.
  [#11](https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/scuttle/pull/11)
